    "Coordinates are in TUREF / TM27 (EPSG:5253), metres.",
    "",
    "x / y are the ANALYSIS coordinates used for every result. They were recovered",
    "by searching for the r.viewshed observer whose output best matches each viewshed",
    "raster of the first submission (Jaccard at 0.4 m given per focus); those rasters",
