    "the manually placed points in 03_gis_inputs/viewshed_foci.shp; moved_m is the",
    "distance between the two. See 04_results/_superseded/Null-model_v1_sea_included/recovered_observers.json.",
    "",
    "\"name\" equals the raster file name (<name>_land.tif) in 04_results/Viewshed_landmasked_0.4m_rerun/ and the 'name'",
    "attribute of viewshed_foci.shp."
